1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,560
Why does your brain think 3.99 is

2
00:00:02,560 --> 00:00:03,360
three dollars?

3
00:00:03,360 --> 00:00:05,520
A shopkeeper prices a lamp at four

4
00:00:05,520 --> 00:00:05,840
dollars,

5
00:00:05,840 --> 00:00:06,880
and sells none.

6
00:00:06,880 --> 00:00:08,320
So he drops it one cent,

7
00:00:08,320 --> 00:00:09,600
to 3.99,

8
00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:10,640
